dstat for Debian
----------------

This package is built from the maintained fork at
https://github.com/helixzz/dstat (0.8.x).  It replaces the unmaintained
0.7.4 package and includes the Python 3 fix for network counter regression:
a veth/tap interface disappearing used to crash dstat with

    OverflowError: cannot convert float infinity to integer

This is a Debian native package, so the version in debian/changelog is the
version of this fork.
